WEBVTT

00:09:29.796 --> 00:09:33.356
Now we need the social and economic
policies to make this work for people.

00:09:34.236 --> 00:09:36.996
And this isn't just
a moral preference for fairness.

00:09:37.476 --> 00:09:39.836
This is also about effective policy.

00:09:40.516 --> 00:09:43.116
Everywhere in the world
is facing these same challenges.

00:09:43.716 --> 00:09:46.156
And businesses want
to invest in the solutions

00:09:46.196 --> 00:09:48.516
in the places where government
is really thinking

00:09:48.516 --> 00:09:50.716
about how to create
the conditions for change

00:09:50.716 --> 00:09:53.276
and how to build
a widespread public support.

00:09:54.276 --> 00:09:56.676
The people-side of this
is not somebody else's job.

00:09:56.716 --> 00:09:58.876
This is our job as environmentalist too.